ounded polling and WAV download validation, effective-model pinning, mocked HTTP tests, and an opt-in manual smoke-test procedure. Verified: 55 backend/project tests and 19 analysis tests pass (3 pre-existing Python deprecation warnings).\",\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:16:25Z\",\"event\":\"commented\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:16:27Z\",\"event\":\"labeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:16:27Z\",\"event\":\"unlabeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:17:16Z\",\"event\":\"cross-referenced\",\"source\":51}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:17:17Z\",\"event\":\"labeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:17:17Z\",\"event\":\"unlabeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:17:17Z\",\"event\":\"labeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":\"8ea469622cac02dac1106d15fbb1c539fedc8630\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:17:20Z\",\"event\":\"referenced\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:20:42Z\",\"event\":\"labeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:20:43Z\",\"event\":\"unlabeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:20:45Z\",\"event\":\"labeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:20:45Z\",\"event\":\"unlabeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":\"9956419bcd25cba22bd90754032dbb8319d97999\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:20:48Z\",\"event\":\"referenced\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":null,\"commit_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-20T14:20:49Z\",\"event\":\"labeled\",\"source\":null}\n{\"body\":\"Fix cycle 1 complete: source-upload reuse is now durable and sc