ion must persist and share the original upload across vocals/bass/drums/guitar, then upload the instrumental once for the cascade\\u2014two uploads total. It must also make preflight cost-safe for every supported source: derive the outstanding-operation sum from authoritative uploaded durations (including the instrumental cascade) and refuse all paid submissions when duration cannot be established or credits are insufficient. Add mocked regression tests for both cases.\"}}\n/Users/marekkucharski/projects/vgt/.pm/log.ndjson:5062:{\"ts\": \"2026-07-20T14:20:48.407065+00:00\", \"project\": \"vgt\", \"event\": \"agent.fix_started\", \"detail\": {\"issue\": 45, \"agent\": \"codex\", \"fix_count\": 1, \"pid\": 55970, \"process_started_at\": \"Mon Jul 20 16:20:46 2026\"}}\n/Users/marekkucharski/projects/vgt/.pm/log.ndjson-5063-{\"ts\": \"2026-07-20T14:20:50.242931+00:00\", \"project\": \"vgt\", \"event\": \"orchestrator.pass_outcome\", \"detail\": {\"outcomes\": [\"deferred\", \"scheduled\"], \"scheduled\": 1, \"followups_created\": 0}}\n/Users/marekkucharski/projects/vgt/.pm/log.ndjson-5064-{\"ts\": \"2026-07-20T14:21:57.258182+00:00\", \"project\": \"vgt\", \"event\": \"orchestrator.pass_outcome\", \"detail\": {\"outcomes\": [\"deferred\"], \"scheduled\": 0, \"followups_created\": 0}}\n/Users/marekkucharski/projects/vgt/.pm/log.ndjson-5065-{\"ts\": \"2026-07-20T14:21:57.258574+00:00\", \"project\": \"vgt\", \"event\": \"orchestrator.no_capacity\", \"detail\": {\"message\": \"work is available, but scheduler capacity or budget headroom is exhausted\"}}\n/Users/marekkucharski/projects/vgt/.pm/log.ndjson-5066-{\"ts\": \"2026-07-20T14:23:04.304428+00:00\", \"project\": \"vgt\", \"event\": \"orchestrator.pass_outcome\", \"detail\": {\"outcomes\": [\"deferred\"], \"scheduled\": 0, \"followups_created\": 0}}\n/Users/marekkucharski/projects/vgt/.pm/log.ndjson-5067-{\"ts\": \"2026-07-20T14:23:04.304686+00:00\", \"project\": \"vgt\", \"event\": \"orchestrator.no_capacity\", \"deta